      "id": "customer-discovery",
      "name": "Customer discovery",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "ready",
      "category": "validation",
      "description": "Plans customer interviews and reads what they found. It writes the best-fit customer, where to recruit them, screening questions, and an interview guide that asks about past behavior instead of pitching. It turns the user's own notes into an evidence table of pain, workarounds, and commitments, then names the next experiment. It never invents interviews or quotes.",
