      "id": "market-research",
      "name": "Market research",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "ready",
      "category": "validation",
      "description": "A source-backed market assessment. It defines the market and its buyer segments, sizes TAM, SAM, and SOM bottom-up with the formula behind each figure and a low-to-high range, and adds trends, demand signals, and the alternatives buyers use. It rates how attractive the market is and lists the evidence still missing. Every assumed input is labeled.",
