      "id": "mvp-planner",
      "name": "MVP plan",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "ready",
      "category": "planning",
      "description": "Turns customer evidence into the smallest product a narrow first group of users can get value from. It names the first users and their most urgent problem, maps the main user journey, and sorts features into now, later, and never. It writes user stories with acceptance criteria, the steps to do by hand first, risks, a time-boxed build plan, launch metrics, and the result that would mean stop or change course.",
