      "id": "financial-model",
      "name": "Financial model",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "ready",
      "category": "planning",
      "description": "A monthly, assumption-driven startup financial model. It lists the revenue drivers, costs, and hires, then builds monthly customers, revenue, costs, net, and cash with a cash chart. It adds the annual summary, break-even, runway, unit economics, a default alive check, three scenarios, sensitivity, the funding need, and reconciliation checks. Every driver is labeled given, sourced, derived, or assumption.",
