      "id": "lead-generation",
      "name": "Lead generation",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "ready",
      "category": "growth",
      "description": "An outbound prospecting system for founder-led sales. It writes the sales hypothesis, qualification criteria and a scorecard, the lawful lead sources to search, and the fields to record for each prospect. It adds a short outreach sequence with personalization rules, pipeline stages, a funnel worked backwards from the customer goal, and the outreach rules for the country. It does not send messages or invent contacts.",
